@startuml Truck List Entry

title A vehicle on a convoy (truck-list entry)
caption Target design. Convoy operations: Truck-list entry. Decisions O8, P5, P11. ADRs 0001, 0015.

state "On the list" as Listed : crew, insurance, ferry, boxes,\nhandover Receiver, manifest, declarations
state "Travelling" as Travelling : convoy departed
state "Delivered" as Delivered : marked arrived (O8)
state "Handed over" as HandedOver : the vehicle stays in Ukraine;\nnever offered again
state "Withdrawn" as Withdrawn : broke down or left; a stamp,\nnot a delete; may join a later convoy

[*] --> Listed : add vehicle\n[inspection Passed]
Listed --> [*] : removed\n[truck list not published]
Listed --> Withdrawn : withdraw\n[truck list published]
Listed --> Travelling : convoy departs
Travelling --> Withdrawn : withdraw (breakdown)
Travelling --> Delivered : delivered
Delivered --> HandedOver : convoy arrives
HandedOver --> [*]
Withdrawn --> [*]

note right of Withdrawn
  Entry, crew, insurance and manifest are kept.
  Withdrawn vehicles are skipped by readiness and arrival.
end note

@enduml
